1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
What if you kept growing taller and never stopped?

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:07,380
At 7 feet, life is amazing—NBA scouts are blowing up your phone.

3
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:11,620
At 20 feet, you smash through your roof and sleep in a Walmart parking lot.

4
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:16,760
At 100 feet, the military gives up—and the IRS taxes you in three zip codes.

5
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:20,760
At 50,000 feet, your head hits space and freezes solid.

6
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:25,560
Congrats—you're dead, and your landlord still kept your security deposit for the hole in the ceiling.

7
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,900
Subscribe—and comment what height you'd finally quit your job.
